  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759020,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Pin for Commodore 64 - Strike Out the Competition!\n\nStep up to the lanes in *10 Pin*, a thrilling bowling simulation for the Commodore 64! Experience the satisfying clatter of pins and the rush of a perfect strike from a unique, behind-the-bowler perspective. Fine-tune your game with precise left-right bowler positioning and adjustable camera angles (+/- keys). Choose your dominant hand (R or L) to personalize your approach.\n\nMaster the art of the release – a forward joystick movement combined with the fire button sends your ball hurtling down the lane. Be mindful of your run-up; overextending results in a foul! The game automatically calculates scores, aiming for that elusive 300. \n\n*10 Pin* delivers realistic physics and challenging gameplay, offering a genuine bowling experience. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or a casual player, prepare to test your skills and chase the perfect game! Can you consistently knock down all ten pins and become a bowling champion?"
    },
